{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cognitive interactivity cognitive interactivity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md","fileName":"Cognitive Interactivity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Cognitive Interactivity","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Game Interactivity]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Interactivity","Systemic Depth","advancedgamedesign.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"cognitive interactivity cognitive interactivity","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md","fileName":"Cognitive Interactivity.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Cognitive Interactivity","heading":"Cognitive Interactivity","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Cognitive interactivity consists of deliberate reasoning about tactics, strategy, planning, prediction, learning, and mastery. Short-term cognitive loops guide immediate choices, while long-term loops organize plans and progression.\n\nIt depends on understandable goals, sufficiently predictable consequences, and [[Systemic Depth]]. If the game supplies neither useful uncertainty nor a coherent model to learn, the player has little reason to think through its decisions.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Game Interactivity","Systemic Depth","advancedgamedesign.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Cognitive Interactivity.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName